title: Portable Executable Injection
id: befdfee9-63a8-4481-990e-7fac50df8888
status: experimental
description: Detects portable executable injection, where a full PE image is written into and executed within another process (Sysmon event 8 with a start address in unbacked memory of a target it did not create).
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/002/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: create_remote_thread
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 8
  filter:
    StartModule|contains: '.dll'
  condition: selection and not filter
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SourceImage
  - TargetImage
  - StartAddress
falsepositives:
  - Security tools that inject threads
level: high
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1055.002
